  <dashboards>
    <dashboard name="Dashboard layout B (b1)">
      <style />
      <size maxheight='768' maxwidth='1366' minheight='768' minwidth='1366' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
        <zone h='9600' id='11' type='text' w='98000' x='1000' y='400'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='20'>Late deliveries cost about 3,110 bad reviews; </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#D55E00' fontsize='20'>late seller handoffs are the biggest fixable cause</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='11'>Orders bought Jan 2017 to Aug 2018  ·  94,931 delivered orders  ·  6,518 late (6.87%)  ·  late = arrived after the promised day</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#808080' fontsize='9'>In Tableau: click a seller, region or month bar to filter</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='14600' id='12' type='text' w='32000' x='1000' y='10200'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>1  COST</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='27'>≈3,110</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>extra 1-2 star reviews linked to late delivery</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>range 2,880 to 3,350  ·  26.7% of all 11,635 bad reviews</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='background-color' value='#F2F2F2' /><format attr='margin' value='4' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='14600' id='13' type='text' w='32000' x='34000' y='10200'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>2  THIS MONTH VS GOAL</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='27'>6.3%</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>Aug 2018 late rate against the 4.4% goal</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>alarm line 8.4% this month</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='background-color' value='#F2F2F2' /><format attr='margin' value='4' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='14600' id='14' type='text' w='32000' x='67000' y='10200'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>3  HANDOFF GAP</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#D55E00' fontsize='27'>21.2%</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>of orders handed over late arrive late, vs 5.4% when handed over on time</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>late handoffs start 27.8% of all late orders</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='background-color' value='#F2F2F2' /><format attr='margin' value='4' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='9000' id='15' type='text' w='32000' x='1000' y='25000'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>1  </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='12'>Reviews turn bad fast: 8.7% are 1-2 stars up to the promised day, about 78% from day 6 late</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>share of reviews that are 1-2 stars, by days past the promised day</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='23600' id='16' name="Review ramp" show-title='false' w='32000' x='1000' y='34000'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='2' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='9000' id='17' type='text' w='32000' x='34000' y='25000'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>2  </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='12'>Late rate sits above the 4.4% goal; Nov 2017, Feb 2018 and Mar 2018 broke the alarm line</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>gray line = alarm line (moves with order count; typical month 8.4%)</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='23600' id='18' name="Trend" show-title='false' w='32000' x='34000' y='34000'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='2' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='9000' id='19' type='text' w='32000' x='67000' y='25000'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>3  </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#D55E00' fontsize='12'>Late handoffs: 21.2% of those orders arrive late, vs 5.4%</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>1,809 of 8,530 late; they start 27.8% of all 6,518 late orders</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='23600' id='20' name="Handoff" show-title='false' w='32000' x='67000' y='34000'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='4' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='9000' id='21' type='text' w='32000' x='1000' y='58200'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>4  </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='12'>Calling 10 sellers will not fix it: the top 10 hold only 19% of the 1,809 late orders after a late handoff</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>late orders after a late handoff, top 10 of 583 sellers</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='25200' id='22' name="Sellers" show-title='false' w='32000' x='1000' y='67200'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='2' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='9000' id='23' type='text' w='32000' x='34000' y='58200'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>5  </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='12'>North and northeast run 12.2% late vs 6.2% elsewhere</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>late rate by region</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='14000' id='24' name="Region" show-title='false' w='32000' x='34000' y='67200'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='2' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='9000' id='25' type='text' w='32000' x='67000' y='58200'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='12'>6  </run><run bold='true' fontcolor='#222222' fontsize='12'>48.3% of late orders came in 3 months: Nov 2017, Feb 2018 and Mar 2018</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>those 3 months held 21.7% of all orders (15% of months)</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='0' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='25200' id='26' name="Months" show-title='false' w='32000' x='67000' y='67200'><zone-style><format attr='border-style' value='none' /><format attr='margin' value='2' /></zone-style></zone>
        <zone h='6800' id='27' type='text' w='98000' x='1000' y='93100'><formatted-text><run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='11'>Next: test these fixes (EXAMPLE, not run)</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='9'>      invented example numbers, only to show the layout</run><run>Æ&#10;</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Ship-by reminder, handoffs after ship-by: </run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#8A8A8A' fontsize='10'>e.g. 9.0%</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> usual way vs </run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#8A8A8A' fontsize='10'>e.g. 6.1%</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> in the test group   ·   Buffer days north/northeast, average stars: </run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#8A8A8A' fontsize='10'>e.g. 3.92</run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> vs </run><run bold='false' fontcolor='#8A8A8A' fontsize='10'>e.g. 4.05</run></formatted-text><zone-style><format attr='border-color' value='#555555' /><format attr='border-style' value='dashed' /><format attr='border-width' value='1' /><format attr='margin' value='4' /></zone-style></zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{B999A7C3-BCC5-535B-4C8E-277E18B7B6E1}' />
    </dashboard>
